If maximizing total gains for everyone, set the price at the market‐clearing level that balances the highest buyer willingness and the seller’s minimum cost (i.e., the price that maximizes buyer surplus plus seller surplus).  

I did not say or report anything about my client’s limits or situation that was not true.  


